Well, i am using DemoPlayer and HLSRendererBuilder from demo directory in project, these are the methods i am using for switching:

``` java
private HlsRendererBuilder createRenderer() {
        String userAgent = Util.getUserAgent(this, "ExoplayerTest");
        return new HlsRendererBuilder(this, userAgent, contentUri.toString());
    }

    private void preparePlayer() {
        if (player == null) {
            player = new DemoPlayer(createRenderer());
            player.addListener(this);
            player.setCaptionListener(this);
            player.setMetadataListener(this);
            playerNeedsPrepare = true;

        }
        if (playerNeedsPrepare) {
            player.prepare();
            playerNeedsPrepare = false;
        }
        player.setSurface(surfaceView.getHolder().getSurface());
        player.setPlayWhenReady(true);
    }

    private void releasePlayer() {
        if (player != null) {
            //playerPosition = player.getCurrentPosition();
            player.release();
            player = null;

        }
    }
```

and this is the way i am using those methods: 

``` javascript
    releasePlayer();
    preparePlayer();
```

only thing i am reusing is surfaceView, unless there is something in DemoPlayer and HLSRendererBuilder that i have missed, but that shouldn't be the case since it never happened with nonencrypted streams
